iginal":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"TLA9"}]},{"client_msg_id":"c6705dea-29b9-4aca-9b46-efbd21e7c992","type":"message","user":"U03C4RC8X","text":"--\nBBQ pork back ribs, 買ったやつに２枚入ってたので、もう一枚分後日挑戦できます。今度は違う感じにやってみるぞー","ts":"1631052878.254900","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"Q0w/t"}]},{"client_msg_id":"7231f339-b167-4d0d-81f8-623ce9e2493e","type":"message","user":"U03C4RC8X","text":"ただ、一つ問題があって、餃子と天津飯の時点ですでに完全食なので、正直蛇足といわざるをえない感じになります。おいしいのに","ts":"1631052840.253600","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"Ttwsq"}]},{"client_msg_id":"5923d67d-e7d9-46f5-a6ba-30d14fed4c3c","type":"message","user":"U03C4RC8X","text":"ただし単体としては正直弱い感があります。餃子と天津飯とビールが揃ってはじめて完全食となります","ts":"1631052823.253000","team":"T03C4RC8V","reactions":[{"name":"wakaru","count":1,"users":["U022PB40WAF"]}],"replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"YUJe"}]},{"client_msg_id":"83b7bcf5-c029-427c-8f75-16d025accff4","type":"message","user":"U03C4RC8X","text":"あとこれは個体差がけっこうあるけど、餃子の王将の唐揚げとチューリップ好きです","ts":"1631052799.252400","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"HotL"}]},{"client_msg_id":"b4e27ce4-2fd3-492e-a555-b39a14da6dd2","type":"message","user":"U022PB40WAF","text":"からあげ縁は聞いたことありますが、最寄り店舗が車で片道45分…。","ts":"1631052607.251800","team":"T03C4RC8V","reactions":[{"name":"car","count":1,"users":["U03C4RC8X"]}],"replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"cP5+"}]},{"client_msg_id":"7c0c6c8f-cbaf-4cce-8c7e-faaaa0b8f3f3","type":"message","user":"U022PB40WAF","text":"基準点としては「大手コンビニのフライドチキン」より美味しければいいかなと。たぶんそれが一番想像しやすい味だと思いますので。","ts":"1631052107.251600","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"tSR1"}]